ont-weight: 400;\">Keeping a clear head helps you spot trends and make smarter bets.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f830332 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f830332\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Top Dragon and Tiger Tricks for Winning\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fadb126 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fadb126\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfdca47 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cfdca47\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22bf9c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"22bf9c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Observing Patterns</b></h3><h4><b>How to Identify Trends</b></h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Watch the cards dealt in previous rounds. Patterns often emerge, like a streak of wins for Dragon or Tiger.</span></p><h4><b>Betting Based on Patterns</b></h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once a trend is spotted, capitalize on it. However, remember that streaks can end unexpectedly.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e86107 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0e86107\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57167bd elementor-widg